C. what sets the speed: the bath refill rate gamma. Real numbers, one qubit, w = 1.278 kT:
   transmon at 0.2 K, refill 1 MHz                 : up to 7.69e-19 W per qubit
   transmon at 0.2 K, refill 10 MHz (tunable bath) : up to 7.69e-18 W per qubit
   room temperature, refill 1 GHz                  : up to 1.15e-12 W per qubit
   (for scale, the Aalto autonomous engine emits about 5e-18 W)

